  message: "The network half is closed by PR #2110: backend_index_scip_python sets PIP_DISABLE_PIP_VERSION_CHECK=1. Evidence: under strace, upstream pip 24.0's 'pip3 list --format=json' made 1 connect to a closed-port index launched bare and 0 through the wrapper. pip 26.2.2 (exempts list) and Debian's pip 24.0 (check off by default) made 0 either way. This item still covers the pip/python launches themselves."  # 86bd
